sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 用户查询
    participant API as getCounts
    participant Backoff as 退避检查
    participant RateLimit as 限流器
    participant Lock as 分布式锁
    participant Rebuild as 重建逻辑

    User->>API: 请求计数
    API->>API: 读取 SDS
    Note over API: SDS 不存在<br/>needRebuild=true

    API->>Backoff: inBackoff?
    
    alt 正在退避期
        Backoff-->>API: true
        API-->>User: 返回 0<br/>(降级结果)
        Note over API,Backoff: 保护机制生效<br/>避免重建风暴
    else 不在退避期
        Backoff-->>API: false
        
        API->>RateLimit: tryAcquire?
        
        alt 超过限流
            RateLimit-->>API: false
            API->>Backoff: escalateBackoff<br/>(升级退避级别)
            API-->>User: 返回 0
        else 允许通过
            RateLimit-->>API: true
            
            API->>Lock: tryLock?
            
            alt 获取锁失败
                Lock-->>API: false
                API->>Backoff: escalateBackoff
                API-->>User: 返回 0
            else 获取锁成功
                Lock-->>API: true
                API->>Rebuild: 从 Bitmap 重建
                Rebuild-->>API: 成功
                
                API->>Backoff: resetBackoff<br/>(重置为正常状态)
                API->>Lock: unlock
                API-->>User: 返回真实计数
            end
        end
    end
